<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Starter Website</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            background-color: #f4f4f9;
        }
        header {
            background: #2c3e50;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }
        nav a {
            color: #fff;
            margin-left: 1rem;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        nav a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        .hero {
            background: #3498db;
            color: #fff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 4rem 1rem;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 2rem auto;
            padding: 0 1rem;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #27ae60;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background: #219150;
        }
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1rem;
            background: #2c3e50;
            color: #fff;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h2>My Brand</h2>
        <nav>
            <a href="#home">Home</a>
            <a href="#about">About</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <h1>Welcome to My Website</h1>
        <p>A simple, clean starter template built with HTML and CSS.</p>
        <a href="#about" class="btn">Learn More</a>
    </section>

    <main class="container" id="about">
        <h2>About This Page</h2>
        <p>This template includes a standard navigation bar, hero banner, content area, and footer. You can customize the text, colors, and layout directly in the file.</p>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 My Website. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
